            "review_title": "Review at Dozo Sushi Dining",
            "review_text": "Dong Hun Kyle C\n13 contributions\n0\nThe Best restaurant in Hanoi\nJan 2026 • Family\nAs a lifelong lover of Japanese cuisine, I can confidently say this place has claimed the top spot on my list — not just in Hanoi, but compared to many restaurants I’ve tried in Japan, Korea and the US.\n\nThis restaurant is located on the 6th floor of Tower C6, D’Capitale. Dozo Sushi Dining is a definite place that redefines what freshness really means. \n\nThe raw fish tasted like it was caught just a minute ago — every piece of nigiri, hand-pressed by the chef, melted in my mouth like butter. The tuna sashimi was flawless — silky, pure, not in a frozen piece. The shrimp topped with caviar gives you a absolute taste in every bite. \n\nThe real showstopper, though, was the warm dish of Japanese chawanmushi crowned with a fresh uni. One bite, and I literally had to close my eyes.\n\nLastly the draft beer is like a honey. It is so smooth, lightly sweet so that brings a feeling of danger as it was very easy to keep refilling. I lost count of how many I had.\n\nThe best surprise would be the price. For such extraordinary quality, the bill was far more reasonable than I expected. \n\nYou walk out feeling like you just got away with hapiness. I almost never write reviews, but this one feels necessary. If you’re in Hanoi and love sushi — or just incredible food and kind service— drop to Dozo Sushi Dining.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nOrder variety kinds of food in small quantity!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 13, 2026\nDozo Sushi Dining Restaurant\nThank you so much for taking the time to share such a thoughtful and beautifully written review.\nWe are truly honored by your kind words and by the comparisons you made with restaurants in Japan, Korea, and the United States. That level of praise means a great deal to our entire team.\n\nWe are delighted to hear that you enjoyed the freshness of our sushi and sashimi, especially the nigiri, tuna, shrimp with caviar, and our chawanmushi with uni. Your description captures exactly what our chefs strive for every day—precision, freshness, and dishes that create memorable moments. Knowing that a dish made you pause and close your eyes is the highest compliment we could receive.\n\nWe are also very happy you enjoyed our draft beer and found it dangerously smooth—that made us smile. And of course, we are glad the value matched your expectations. Providing exceptional quality at a fair price is something we care deeply about.\n\nThank you again for recommending us and for sharing your experience so sincerely. We look forward to welcoming you back to Dozo Sushi Dining at D’Capitale and creating many more unforgettable meals for you.\n\n“Customers who leave a review will receive a free Omakase sushi coupon, which can be used on your next visit.”\nRead more\nWritten January 14, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
