            "review_text": "Rhys M\n4 contributions\n0\nFirst time at a new sushi restaurant\nJan 2026 • Couples\nService was great the fish is fresh … recommend the soft shell crab salad … menu has plenty tp choose from we went for sushi also the sashimi was good … there are also plenty of hot dishes to choose from\nWritten January 2, 2026\nDozo Sushi Dining Restaurant\nThank you very much for your kind review. We are glad to hear that you enjoyed the service and found the fish fresh. We especially appreciate your recommendation of the soft shell crab salad. It is also great to know that you enjoyed both the sushi and sashimi, as well as the variety of hot dishes on our menu. We truly appreciate your recommendation and look forward to welcoming you again soon.\n\nCustomers who leave a review will receive a free Omakase sushi coupon, which can be used on your next visit.\nRead more\nWritten January 5, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
